{"version":1,"key":"card:283","content":{"id":283,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"45b8c809-3fbb-4ab6-b647-90f1b8e1bd05","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"数组的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"slice"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法是对数组内的元素进行拷贝，然后返回一个新的数组，该方法接收两个参数，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"begin"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"end"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，表示拷贝的起始位置和终止位置，这两个参数都是可选的，如果默认没有传入参数的话，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"begin"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的默认值是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"0"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"end"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 默认表示拷贝到数组的最后一个元素"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"f77cc042-2ddb-4609-8c2c-bbb2b254ba5e","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"b8484d49-6a46-44b4-bce6-ef09b0ad68be","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const arr = [\"red\", \"green\", \"blue\"];\n\nconst newArr = arr.slice(0, 2);\nconsole.log(newArr);                  // [ 'red', 'green' ]\nconsole.log(newArr instanceof Array); // true","collabId":"73aa2650-12ef-466e-abc2-133f41ac8398","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"471b2360-9eac-4373-a20c-ed46f677d153","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"slice"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 返回的是一个数组，它是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Array"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型的实例，现在如果我们自定义类 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"MyArray"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 继承 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Array"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类，调用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"slice"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"a5aa4041-bb3e-46c4-8d71-185eb77b184e","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"5c06a3f4-9379-4731-ade3-5bd2e54286d4","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"class MyArray extends Array {}\n\nlet arr = new MyArray();\narr.push(...[\"red\", \"green\", \"blue\"]);\n\nlet newArr = arr.slice();\nconsole.log(newArr instanceof MyArray); // true\nconsole.log(newArr instanceof Array);   // true","collabId":"6ef616fc-8ba9-4873-9012-cc81c37d1d58","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fb3162f9-fc91-4565-9dbd-47b4d19c3070","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"slice"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法返回的是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"MyArray"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的实例，而不是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Array"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 实例，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"slice"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法返回的是谁的实例是由 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Symbol.species"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性决定的。如果在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"MyArray"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中添加了一个静态方法 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"[Symbol.species]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，它返回的值是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Array"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"slice"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法返回的就是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Array"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的实例。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"8338e7c1-c564-45b8-8482-1520528504a9","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"0559c5ce-f693-4fad-887b-6dffcd2129ab","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"class MyArray extends Array {\n  static get [Symbol.species]() {\n    return Array;\n  }\n}\n\nconst arr = new MyArray();\narr.push(...[\"red\", \"green\", \"blue\"]);\n\nconst newArr = arr.slice();\nconsole.log(newArr instanceof MyArray); // false\nconsole.log(newArr instanceof Array);   // true","collabId":"31e2377b-3938-4692-b6df-5f77de1095a2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/Symbol"],"createTime":1692112889770,"updateTime":1744034543055,"linkedCards":[{"id":249,"target":{"key":"card:249","type":"card","id":249},"summary":"Symbol 是 ES6 引入的一种新的原始类型，类型的值唯一的，每个被创建出来的 Symbol 变量都是不同的，这是 Symbol 这种数据类型最大的特点，常常用于作为对象的属性，以防止被不正确篡改。 Symbol 不能通过字面量来进行创...","tags":["JavaScript/Symbol"]},{"id":276,"target":{"key":"card:276","type":"card","id":276},"summary":"JavaScript 不同于 Java、C++ 等典型的面向对象语言，JavaScript 在过去并没有类的概念，所以一些从 Java 或 C++ 等其他面向语言转过来的开发者会感到困惑，所以在 ES6 中引入了类的概念。 使用关键字 cl...","tags":["JavaScript/类"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1744034543055}}